    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a cycle that never ends. no matter how many \"small steps\" i take, i'm still just this heavy thing she has to drag around. i see her staying up late, looking so tired, and i realize that if i wasn't even here, she could actually breathe. she could have her own life back. it almost feels like the only way to actually be kind to her would be to stop being a problem for her to solve.",
